%% MUPP-041 Secret Santa: the draw
%% Start and stop of the draw by the administrator, the rules and their fallbacks, and what is kept and mailed.
flowchart TD
    P[Förbereder] -->|toggle Startad on, Är du säker? R2| C{two or more participants?}
    C -->|no| X[Nothing saved, nothing mailed, the admin is told why, R3]
    C -->|yes| D[Draw with all rules]
    D -->|not possible| D2[Drop last year's rule]
    D2 -->|not possible| D3[Drop the partner rule]
    D --> R[One row per giver in ss_draw, R4]
    D2 --> R
    D3 --> R
    R --> S[Startad; Aktiv locked on, members locked]
    S --> M[Mail 3 to everyone, R6]
    S --> N[The admin is told which rule was set aside, never who drew whom, R3 R5]
    M -->|a mail fails| W[The draw stands, the admin sees who got none]
    S -->|toggle Startad off, Är du säker? R7| T[Delete this year's rows; wishes kept]
    T --> P
    T --> M4[Mail 4 to everyone]
    I[Inaktiv] -. Startad off and locked .-> I
    R -->|next year| L[Last year's rows feed the rule, R4]
